# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Sensitive or private local files
#
# Scan results, captures, and client or lab data can contain information that
# must not be published. Keep these local unless explicitly cleared.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
private/
local/
drafts/
*.private.*
*.pcap
*.pcapng
*.cap
*.nessus
*.kdbx
scan-results/
loot/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Unpublished source material
#
# These directories hold the originals the website was built from: issued
# certificates, raw screenshots, and the resume PDF. The resume PDF carries a
# home address and a phone number, and most of the certificates were not
# selected for publication. Only the curated copies under
# `website/public/certificates/` are meant to be public, so keep the originals
# out of the repository entirely.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
portfolio-content/
documents/
backup/
